r rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the last version that was healthy in production.\n- I have not rolled anything back. A rollback to v2.3.0 is an option if you want one, but that is your call.\n\nI also did not open an incident yet. The SEV3 was meant to record the deployment, and there is no deployment to record. Opening it now would page the on-call engineer. Given the 18% error rate on production, you may want to raise the current v2.3.1 problem separately, and I can open an incident for that if you ask.", "type": "text"}]}]}